               <msContents>
                  <summary>I) Gadla Takla Hāymānot “Vita of Takla Haymanot” (fols. 4ra-149ra)
                     II) Maṣḥafa lǝdätu la-ʾabuna Takla Hāymānot “Book of the Genealogy of ʾabuna
                     Takla Haymanot” (fols. 149ra-151vb)
 - Genealogy of Takla Hāymānot (fols.
                     149ra-150rb)
 - Wa-nabara ʾabbā Yoḥanni ba-Dabra Dāmmo... “And ʾabbā
                     Yoḥanni lived in Dabra Dāmmo...” (fol. 150rb-vb)
 - Zenā mänakosat “The
                     Story of the Monks” (fols. 150vb-151vb)
 
 Additiones 1-4.</summary>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">

                     <incipit>
                        <foreign xml:lang="en"/>
                     </incipit>
                     <explicit>
                        <foreign xml:lang="en"/>
                     </explicit>
                     <note/>
                  </msItem>
                  
